        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5122HLO, Helios Key in Lever with Modern Square Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Keyed Helios Lever with Modern Square Rosette is available in two functions: a keyed entry--where a key operates the latch from the exterior--and a dummy key in lever--which does not latch nor lock. The Helios Key in Lever with Square Rose will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. This modern keyed leverset is a great way to add extra security to your residential doors--making it the perfect chic way to lock your office or closet. It uses a Schlage C keyway, so it can be keyed alike to your <a href=\"/products/square-single-cylinder-deadbolt-emtek-8469\">matching Single Cylinder Square Deadbolt</a> so you only need one key to access your entire home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> for the Emtek Square Rosette with Helios Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 2-1/2\" Square</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 2-1/8\" door preparations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. The lock is operated by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, keys, door latch, and strike plate.\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> Trim for non-working doors. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nLevers are Handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-levers-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354533\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Keyed Helios Lever with Modern Square Rosette",
                "description": "The Keyed Helios Lever with Modern Square Rosette is available in two functions: a keyed entry--where a key operates the latch from the exterior--and a dummy key in lever--which does not latch nor lock. The Helios Key in Lever with Square Rose will fit doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-1/4 inches to 2-3/4 inches thick. This modern keyed leverset is a great way to add extra security to your residential doors--making it the perfect chic way to lock your office or closet. It uses a Schlage C keyway, so it can be keyed alike to your matching Single Cylinder Square Deadbolt so you only need one key to access your entire home.",
